; Stage 15 W9 item 9 at the LOCAL position. `int-literal-fits` is shared, so
; fixing the global initializer fixed `coerce-int-val`'s chokepoint at the same
; time — let/set!/field-store/aset!/return/call-argument all route through it.
; A global-only fixture would not have caught a fix applied only to
; `defvar-init-ir`.
;
; Compiling this must FAIL with:
;   "integer literal 5 does not fit i1"
(defn main ():i32
  (let (a:i1 5)
    (when a (return 1)))
  (return 0))
